{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","readme":"","modules":[{"kind":"javascript-module","path":"src/transcript.ts","declarations":[{"kind":"function","name":"formatTranscriptTime","return":{"type":{"text":"string"}},"parameters":[{"name":"seconds","type":{"text":"number"}}],"description":"`0:42`, or `1:02:10` past an hour."},{"kind":"class","description":"A transcript: speaker-labelled, timestamped segments, synced to playback. Use it beside a meeting recording, a\npodcast or a voice agent.\n\n`segments` holds the text, each with a `start` (and `end`) in seconds and optionally its `words` with their own\ntimes. Consecutive segments by one speaker sit under one header: an avatar, the name and the time. `speakers` maps a\nspeaker id to a name, an avatar and a colour; speakers without a colour take the eight `--c2-transcript__speaker-<n>--color`\nin the order they first speak, so two speakers never share one. `layout=\"compact\"` drops the avatars and puts a time\nbefore every segment, for a narrow side panel.\n\nPlayback comes from `media` (an `<audio>` or `<video>`), or from `current-time` set by the app. The segment playing\nis tinted and, with `words`, the word playing is underlined and the words still to come are muted. Clicking a time,\na segment or a word fires `transcript-seek`; unless it is cancelled, `media` jumps there. While `follow` is on, the\nsegment playing is kept in view in the scroll box (give the element a height); scrolling away pauses that and shows a\n\"Jump to current\" button.\n\n`query` marks every match, ignoring case and accents; `nextMatch()` and `previousMatch()` move between them, and\n`match-change` gives the count for the app's find bar. Segments appended while following keep the view at the bottom,\nand `interim` segments are drawn muted, for live captions.\n\nThe segments are one tab stop: the arrow keys move between them, Enter plays from the one focused.","name":"Transcript","cssProperties":[{"type":{"text":"length"},"description":"Space inside the scroll box.","name":"--c2-transcript--padding","default":"12px"},{"type":{"text":"length"},"description":"Space between speaker groups.","name":"--c2-transcript__group--gap","default":"18px"},{"type":{"text":"font-size"},"name":"--c2-transcript--font-size","default":"14px"},{"type":{"text":"number"},"name":"--c2-transcript--line-height","default":"1.55"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript--color","default":"#18181b"},{"type":{"text":"pixel"},"name":"--c2-transcript__avatar--size","default":"28px"},{"type":{"text":"font-weight"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker--font-weight","default":"600"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__time--color","default":"#71717a"},{"type":{"text":"font-size"},"name":"--c2-transcript__time--font-size","default":"12px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__time__hover--color","default":"rgb(2, 101, 220)"},{"type":{"text":"padding"},"name":"--c2-transcript__segment--padding","default":"2px 6px"},{"type":{"text":"border-radius"},"name":"--c2-transcript__segment--border-radius","default":"6px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__segment__active--background-color","default":"rgba(2, 101, 220, 0.1)"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__segment__focus--outline-color","default":"rgb(2, 101, 220)"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__word__active--decoration-color","default":"rgb(2, 101, 220)"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"Words of the segment playing that are still to come.","name":"--c2-transcript__word__upcoming--color","default":"#71717a"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__interim--color","default":"#71717a"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__mark--background-color","default":"#fef08a"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__mark--color","default":"#18181b"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__mark__current--outline-color","default":"#ca8a04"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__jump--background-color","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__jump--color","default":"#18181b"},{"type":{"text":"border"},"name":"--c2-transcript__jump--border","default":"1px solid #e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"box-shadow"},"name":"--c2-transcript__jump--box-shadow","default":"0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-1--color","default":"#1d4ed8"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-2--color","default":"#b45309"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-3--color","default":"#7e22ce"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-4--color","default":"#047857"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-5--color","default":"#be123c"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-6--color","default":"#0e7490"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-7--color","default":"#4d7c0f"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-transcript__speaker-8--color","default":"#a21caf"}],"cssParts":[{"description":"The scroll box.","name":"scroll"},{"description":"A speaker's run of segments.","name":"group"},{"description":"A speaker's name.","name":"speaker"},{"description":"A timestamp button.","name":"time"},{"description":"A segment.","name":"segment"},{"description":"The \"Jump to current\" button.","name":"jump"}],"members":[{"kind":"field","name":"segments","type":{"text":"TranscriptSegment[]"},"default":"[]","description":"The segments, in time order.","attribute":"segments"},{"kind":"field","name":"speakers","type":{"text":"Record<string, TranscriptSpeaker>"},"default":"{}","description":"Speaker ids mapped to a name, an avatar and a colour.","attribute":"speakers"},{"kind":"field","name":"media","type":{"text":"HTMLMediaElement | null"},"default":"null","description":"An `<audio>` or `<video>` to follow and seek."},{"kind":"field","name":"currentTime","type":{"text":"number | undefined"},"default":"undefined","description":"The playing position in seconds, when there is no `media`.","attribute":"current-time"},{"kind":"field","name":"follow","type":{"text":"boolean"},"default":"true","description":"Keeps the segment playing in view.","attribute":"follow"},{"kind":"field","name":"layout","type":{"text":"'default' | 'compact'"},"default":"'default'","description":"`default`, or `compact`: a time before every segment and no avatars.","attribute":"layout"},{"kind":"field","name":"query","type":{"text":"string"},"default":"''","description":"Text to mark, ignoring case and accents.","attribute":"query"},{"kind":"field","name":"focusIndex","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"0"},{"kind":"field","name":"paused","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","default":"false"},{"kind":"field","name":"matchIndex","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"-1"},{"kind":"field","name":"announcement","type":{"text":"string"},"privacy":"private","default":"''"},{"kind":"field","name":"internals","privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"field","name":"msg","privacy":"private","readonly":true,"default":"new LocalizeController(this, transcriptMessages)"},{"kind":"field","name":"groups","type":{"text":"Group[]"},"privacy":"private","default":"[]"},{"kind":"field","name":"colors","privacy":"private","default":"new Map<string, number>()"},{"kind":"field","name":"found","type":{"text":"Match[]"},"privacy":"private","default":"[]"},{"kind":"field","name":"active","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"-1"},{"kind":"field","name":"activeWord","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"-1"},{"kind":"field","name":"frame","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"0"},{"kind":"field","name":"programmatic","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","default":"false"},{"kind":"field","name":"programmaticTimer","type":{"text":"ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined"},"privacy":"private"},{"kind":"field","name":"atBottom","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","default":"true"},{"kind":"field","name":"listened","type":{"text":"HTMLMediaElement | null"},"privacy":"private","default":"null"},{"kind":"field","name":"pendingMatchScroll","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","default":"false"},{"kind":"field","name":"matchCount","type":{"text":"number"},"description":"How many matches `query` has.","readonly":true},{"kind":"field","name":"currentMatch","type":{"text":"number"},"description":"The match shown, from 0; -1 when there is none.","readonly":true},{"kind":"method","name":"nextMatch","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"description":"Shows the next match, after the last going back to the first."},{"kind":"method","name":"previousMatch","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"description":"Shows the previous match, before the first going round to the last."},{"kind":"field","name":"box","type":{"text":"HTMLElement | null"},"privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"method","name":"segmentElement","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"HTMLElement | null"}},"parameters":[{"name":"index","type":{"text":"number"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"group","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"method","name":"speaker","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"TranscriptSpeaker"}},"parameters":[{"name":"id","type":{"text":"string"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"display","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"{ text: string; offsets: number[] }"}},"parameters":[{"name":"segment","type":{"text":"TranscriptSegment"}}],"description":"The text a segment shows, and where each word starts in it."},{"kind":"field","name":"time","type":{"text":"number | undefined"},"privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"method","name":"endOf","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"number"}},"parameters":[{"name":"index","type":{"text":"number"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"find","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"number"}},"parameters":[{"name":"time","type":{"text":"number"}}],"description":"The segment playing at `time`: the last that started, while it lasts."},{"kind":"method","name":"listen","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"media","type":{"text":"HTMLMediaElement | null"}}]},{"kind":"field","name":"onMedia","privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"method","name":"loop","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"description":"Repaints every frame while the media plays: `timeupdate` comes four times a second, too slow for words."},{"kind":"method","name":"paint","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"fresh","default":"false"}],"description":"Marks the segment and word playing, by hand, so playback never re-renders the transcript. After a render, `fresh`\nputs the marks back from scratch (a node may now hold another segment), and scrolls only if the segment changed."},{"kind":"field","name":"reducedMotion","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"method","name":"scrollBox","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"top","type":{"text":"number"}},{"name":"smooth","default":"true"}],"description":"Scrolls the box (never the page) to `top`, marking the scroll as ours so it does not pause following."},{"kind":"method","name":"reveal","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"element","type":{"text":"HTMLElement"}}],"description":"Brings an element into view in the box, a third of the way down."},{"kind":"method","name":"visible","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"boolean"}},"parameters":[{"name":"element","type":{"text":"HTMLElement"}}]},{"kind":"field","name":"onScroll","privacy":"private","readonly":true,"description":"Pauses following when the reader has scrolled the segment playing out of view."},{"kind":"field","name":"onScrollEnd","privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"field","name":"onUserScroll","type":{"text":"object"},"privacy":"private","readonly":true,"default":"{ handleEvent: () => this.endProgrammatic(), passive: true }","description":"The reader's own wheel or touch takes over from a scroll we started."},{"kind":"method","name":"endProgrammatic","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"method","name":"jump","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"method","name":"seek","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"time","type":{"text":"number"}},{"name":"index","type":{"text":"number"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"onClick","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"event","type":{"text":"MouseEvent"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"onKeydown","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"event","type":{"text":"KeyboardEvent"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"moveMatch","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"parameters":[{"name":"step","type":{"text":"number"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"showMatch","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"method","name":"marked","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"TemplateResult | string"}},"parameters":[{"name":"text","type":{"text":"string"}},{"name":"from","type":{"text":"number"}},{"name":"segment","type":{"text":"number"}}],"description":"`text` (which starts at `from` in the segment's display text) with its matches marked."},{"kind":"method","name":"renderText","privacy":"private","parameters":[{"name":"segment","type":{"text":"TranscriptSegment"}},{"name":"index","type":{"text":"number"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"renderSegment","privacy":"private","parameters":[{"name":"index","type":{"text":"number"}},{"name":"prefix","default":"nothing","type":{"text":"TemplateResult | typeof nothing"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"renderTime","privacy":"private","parameters":[{"name":"index","type":{"text":"number"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"colorStyle","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"string"}},"parameters":[{"name":"id","type":{"text":"string"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"renderGroup","privacy":"private","parameters":[{"name":"group","type":{"text":"Group"}}]},{"kind":"method","name":"renderCompact","privacy":"private"},{"kind":"field","name":"role","type":{"text":"string"},"default":"'region'"}],"events":[{"name":"match-change","type":{"text":"CustomEvent<TranscriptMatchEventDetail>"},"description":"The matches of `query`, or the one shown, changed."},{"type":{"text":"CustomEvent<TranscriptSeekEventDetail>"},"description":"A time, a segment or a word was clicked. Cancel it to keep `media` where it is.","name":"transcript-seek"}],"attributes":[{"name":"segments","type":{"text":"TranscriptSegment[]"},"default":"[]","description":"The segments, in time order.","fieldName":"segments"},{"name":"speakers","type":{"text":"Record<string, TranscriptSpeaker>"},"default":"{}","description":"Speaker ids mapped to a name, an avatar and a colour.","fieldName":"speakers"},{"name":"current-time","type":{"text":"number | undefined"},"default":"undefined","description":"The playing position in seconds, when there is no `media`.","fieldName":"currentTime"},{"name":"follow","type":{"text":"boolean"},"default":"true","description":"Keeps the segment playing in view.","fieldName":"follow"},{"name":"layout","type":{"text":"'default' | 'compact'"},"default":"'default'","description":"`default`, or `compact`: a time before every segment and no avatars.","fieldName":"layout"},{"name":"query","type":{"text":"string"},"default":"''","description":"Text to mark, ignoring case and accents.","fieldName":"query"}],"superclass":{"name":"LitElement","package":"lit"},"tagName":"c2-transcript","customElement":true}],"exports":[{"kind":"js","name":"formatTranscriptTime","declaration":{"name":"formatTranscriptTime","module":"src/transcript.ts"}},{"kind":"js","name":"Transcript","declaration":{"name":"